rresponding engine executor by refining searches with the discovered primitive name, and verify that executor with read_source. Separately use similar_handlers to find an example for this Oracle behavior: \"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature deals 1 damage to any target.\" Report the returned handler path and distinguish a search suggestion from source you actually verified. Use check_capability once on an event or label relevant to your discoveries; do not treat a miss as proof of absent functionality.\nReturn concise JSON with `primitive`, `executor` (symbol_id, path, source_revision, start_line, behavior), `handler_candidate`, `capability_check`, and `limitations`. All claims about source must be supported by read_source output. If a tool result has no symbol_id, do not invent one; try database follow-up or state that source could not be resolved with the current tools. Maximum 9 tool calls, stop once sufficient.\n\n<turn-context>\n<current-time>2026-09-20 09:31:00 +02:00</current-time>\n<working-directory>/tmp/goose-database-tools/primitive/checkout</working-directory>\n</turn-context>"},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_2360a14e92ec4c5ea3ef91d3","type":"function","function":{"name":"card-knowledge__find_capability","arguments":"{\"query\":\"put a counter on a permanent and draw a card\",\"n\":8}"}},{"id":"call_a184ea452c484edb869453c7","type":"function","function":{"name":"card-knowledge__similar_handlers","arguments":"{\"text\":\"Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this creature deals 1 damage to any target.\",\"n\":3}"}}],"content":null,"reasoning_content":"Let me start by searching for the capability: puts a counter on a permanent and draws a card.\n\nI'll do parallel independent calls: find_capability for \"put counter on permanent and draw a card\", and similar_handlers for the oracle text."},{"role":"tool","content":"Lookup aefd6cedfc4a46fc878413170df8aa4d: found; strategy=normalized_all_terms; indexed revision=f8d04f3ce658cafd9fc05a92edd2960e016e36d9\n[handler] MISSING_PRIMITIVE: exile (backend/cardfns/task9005_argent_dais.go) — MISSING_PRIMITIVE: exile-permanent\n[handler] OakaTravelingMerchant implements O'aka, Traveling Merchant (FIC) (backend/cardfns/OakaTravelingMerchant.go) — OakaTravelingMerchant implements O'aka, Traveling Merchant (FIC) —\n[handler] Steady Progress (backend/cardfns/SteadyProgress.go) — Steady Progress — {2}{U} Instant (MM2)\n[handler] Soul Diviner (backend/cardfns/SoulDiviner.go) — Soul Diviner — Artifact\n[handler] KorvoldFaeCursedKing (backend/cardfns/KorvoldFaeCursedKing.go) — KorvoldFaeCursedKing — {2}{B}{R}{G} Legendary Creature — Dragon Noble (EOC)\n[handler] The Watcher in the Water (backend/cardfns/TheWatcherintheWater.go) — The Watcher in the Water — {3}{U}{U} Creature (LTR)\n[handler] Wibbly (backend/cardfns/task226_wibbly_wobbly_timey_wimey.go) — Wibbly-wobbly, Timey-wimey (WHO) — {1}{U} Sorcery.\n[handler] Sharae of Numbing Depths (backend/cardfns/SharaeOfNumbingDepths.go) — Sharae of Numbing Depths — {2}{W}{U} Creature","tool_call_id":"call_2360a14e92ec4c5ea3ef91d3"},{"role":"tool","content":"=== Caldera Pyremaw  (backend/cardfns/CalderaPyremaw.go) ===\nCaldera Pyremaw — {3}{R}{R} Creature (TDC)\n\n\tFlying\n\tWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, put a +1/+1 counter on\n\t  this creature. Then this creature deals damage equal to its power to\n\t  target opponent.\n\nCardHandler: subscribes to EventSpellCast, filtering for instant/sorcery\nspells cast by the controller. On trigger, adds a +1/+1 counter, then\ndeals damage to an opponent equal to the creature's current power.\nAuto-selects the first opponent (engine convention for \"target opponent\"\nin triggers, see AcidicSlime.go / GainControlOfFirstOpponent.go).\n\n\n=== ExaltedFlamerOfTzeentch  (backend/cardfns/ExaltedFlamerOfTzeentch.go) ===\nExaltedFlamerOfTzeentch implements Exalted Flamer of Tzeentch (40K):\n{2}{U}{R} Creature.\n\n\tSorcerous Inspiration — At the beginning of your upkeep, return an\n\t  instant or sorcery card at random from your graveyard to your hand.\n\tFire of Tzeentch — Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, this\n\t  creature deals 1 damage to each opponent.\n\nCardHandler: the upkeep trigger collects the controller's instant/sorcery\ncards in the graveyard and returns a random one (math/rand, same idiom as\nGontiLordOfLuxury/HoardingOgre); the cast trigger mirrors the\nAshlingFlameDancer EventSpellCast filter and fires DamageEachOpponent.\n\n\n=== Mercurial Spelldancer  (backend/cardfns/MercurialSpelldancer.go) ===\nMercurial Spelldancer — {1}{U} Creature (ONE)\n\n\tThis creature can't be blocked.\n\tWhenever you cast a noncreature spell, put an oil counter on this creature.\n\tWhenever this creature deals combat damage to a player, you may remove two\n\toil counters from it. If you do, when you next cast an instant or sorcery\n\tspell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.\n\nCardHandler: grants unblockable via GrantCantBeBlocked. Subscribes to\nEventSpellCast to add an oil counter if the spell is noncreature (instant,\nsorcery, or enchantment). Subscribes to EventDealsPlayerDamage to remove\noil counters and arm a one-shot spell-copy effect. The one-shot copies the\nnext instant or sorcery cast this turn via CopySpellOnStack.\n\n","tool_call_id":"call_a184ea452c484edb869453c7"},{"role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"id":"call_79cb5d69b4d146969439a48f","type":"function","function":{"name":"card-knowledge__find_capability","arguments":"{\"n\":8,\"kind\":\"primitive\",\"query\":\"put counter on permanent draw card\"}"}},{"id":"call_847e1c39f6c042b28e3a0707","type":"function","function":{"name":"card-knowledge__find_capability","arguments":"{\"n\":8,\"kind\":\"helper\",\"query\":\"put counter on permanent and draw a card\"}"}}],"content":null,"reasoning_content":"The first search returned handlers, not primitives. Let me search with kind=primitive for \"put counter o